{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "288a32285221e786f4a5c21a7181822cca37f4f08711b0920c27fdeb278a8a96", "ja": "えっ？\n……貴方が、プロデューサーなんですか？", "zh": "咦？\n……你就是制作人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6b0aacc7f32a675dbaee8d497a41bd77414169b91113694b25aa79bebdef37c7", "ja": "そうだよ。\nそれがどうかした？", "zh": "是啊。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "b4c739d671b9dd993c1cb18badacd0df11aecb48ffdd1659ee67107e01477cc3", "ja": "いえ、何もないです。", "zh": "不，没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "4385644294895d384abc0047ae13f2deb50eb4836d0dac23b0850862f2a1172a", "ja": "……大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "……没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "189e7093dccf5ce0608deb963ad09930de9fb5eb8f52bcdfae0317f6f940c903", "ja": "えっと……プロフィールには、\nピアノを習ってたって書いてあるね。", "zh": "我看看……你的个人资料上，\n有提到你学过钢琴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "438b89d84266cfab622ee828a8c670028f6206f9447c4cfa895b932e24b091d0", "ja": "はい。ピアノは、小さいころから。\nあとはテニスをやっています。", "zh": "是的，钢琴是从小开始学的，\n然后我也有在打网球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "a8586e8fa1cfc19c573f8ae847b2ed5bfc6de440acb38f7319b84812f4497ba5", "ja": "なので、音感は悪くないと思います。\n歌も、自己流ですが練習してきたので……。", "zh": "所以我想自己的音感应该不错。\n也有用自己的方式练习唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "44386fb6d72b26a1883bcea9561d3c23e8feb03ff5f5fd86cadd3eee18531662", "ja": "アイドルになるために必要なことは、\nできる限り学んできたつもりです。", "zh": "成为偶像的必备条件，\n我都有尽力学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e967ce09a012e164784c06e5a6d4b646e786c4eec1f23883705daf257f1356d8", "ja": "オーディションを受ける前から？\nずいぶん熱心なんだね。", "zh": "从参加甄选之前就在学吗？\n你很勤奋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "08e77f09bce8d48adf9222e9017750fee9ccd795ecf5e4eb6056a8591cdec515", "ja": "当然です。\nだって私は、アイドルになりたいんですから。", "zh": "那是当然的。\n因为我想成为偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "85aa90a0abfa8ca3575a81b4fb2ca8283aa8a4661f25d6c06b1ec0a76c96b6ef", "ja": "アイドルを本気で目指しているのなら、\nできる限りのことはしないと。", "zh": "既然是认真想当偶像，\n就要尽力做到好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a2dd725ab291310eea6b106ae338c6d739cae2076bab668fa16f40f1e90a615d", "ja": "なるほど……。それだけ最上さんは、\n真剣にアイドルのことを考えてるんだね？", "zh": "原来如此……这代表最上小姐说想当偶像\n并非玩票性质吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f7e3ac00cd05ed4d470f47de4122871b47756ac77fe5eb5f27eea8f52f58fd5a", "ja": "（本当に真剣な表情だ……。理由はわからないが、\n彼女は本気でそう思っているんだな）", "zh": "（她的表情真的很坚决……虽然不清楚原因，\n但看来她是真心这么想的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca3dd734c7a60fdbe253acd1c63e5899b3086240253c00b2afc255cb68082bef", "ja": "私はこのオーディションに受かって、\n絶対に、アイドルにならなくちゃ……。", "zh": "我一定要通过这场甄选，\n并成为偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "58da78e97567f9d70620b154d7d9bc4f1ba5ed40094bb018e3006e1723741094", "ja": "このチャンスを逃したら……\n私にはもう、後がないから……。", "zh": "要是错过这次机会……\n我就没有退路了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "74a17aa4546643c6a9c1aa5c030cd2767b9d73452ec0e8557bd085c4dfc1e5aa", "ja": "後がない……？", "zh": "没有退路……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "7ea935cad425486662576a9e6ec1aa30079a526060f3bba10677ed2c076ba779", "ja": "っ……お願いします！\n私、どうしてもアイドルになりたいんです！", "zh": "……拜托了！\n我无论如何都想成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "e2673ddcf3284e05d5889cea5f4378435e680c21e83de9309236f04008b84aed", "ja": "アイドルになるためなら、私、なんだってやります！\nだからっ……！", "zh": "为了成为偶像，我什么都愿意做！\n所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "0a880c40bf29b37f497792a01ed1f0d70b906b78ce19b4b50b9f1448bf2f8e58", "ja": "ち、ちょっと待って。", "zh": "你、你等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "7acc995775922e91cfff763a380f9177e1ad07a7d0be0f7703fd6fbed9282243", "ja": "えっ？\n……どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "咦？\n……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b144aaa2f155cefabbd66f6fb4bd7c1460c0f7376af5e94a111cfd1d50077a98", "ja": "いや……ごめん、なんでもないよ。\n君の勢いに、ちょっと気圧されちゃっただけだ。", "zh": "不是……抱歉，没什么。\n我只是有点被你的气势吓到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "f3b3afbfe9995c723053386c49036a958ded07d6c43bdabf7470385543c21010", "ja": "気圧されちゃった……？", "zh": "被我的气势吓到……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1c9a560747dca3758b3122c1440dd0b79d0c574ace2aa24b88ce10ba1f46d0dc", "ja": "（ひどく切羽詰まった表情だった……。\n自分がどんな顔をしていたか、気づいていないのか？）", "zh": "（她刚才的表情好急迫……\n她没意识到自己摆出了什么样的表情吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "5ad07f0de1a97f9f9e8ac5d1085fba06f923d05c69e22510d6ed5c46f76b150a", "ja": "……この人、765プロのプロデューサーなのよね。\nこんな調子で、本当に大丈夫なのかしら……？", "zh": "……这个人真的是765艺能的制作人吧？\n这样下去真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a60926ea68e317abfec2b9078a1221e951619591cbe25012159f941081952269", "ja": "何か言った？", "zh": "你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "26c1a71491e4cd70a83c1b765a65e4ee7a90ca77ebaf3f33a0759ba3139ad05f", "ja": "いえ、何も。\n……とにかく、私はアイドルになりたいんです。", "zh": "不，没什么……\n总而言之，我想成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "38bfeec69b4441e557aef534fd254c4ed4dda3851de798d7c9a029ef58126952", "ja": "少しでも早く、トップにならないと。\nそうしないと……。", "zh": "我得尽快成为顶尖偶像才行。\n不然的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "f233acbaf5c55455459d18be71848fd489b62096e781b42789818b016acbe91e", "ja": "そのためには、貴方の協力が必要なんです。\n……お願いします！", "zh": "为此，我需要你的协助。\n……拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1035_p", "source_sha256": "b5baad4bf5da74b7b05972749a41f2fb96d58ae3d9edb5e05c3f7e3f250b3213", "ja": "（この気迫……それに、アイドルとしての下地を\n進んで学んできたという熱意……）", "zh": "（这股气魄……\n还有积极学习偶像基本功的热情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_1036", "source_sha256": "82ba7c0d8c36a1f2eea44a72c4f98c86ac32928739faf770b0e6dad375a952d7", "ja": "合格だ！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cbb982299af470a879c79e9d785b7826ad5543419d9c5b7129753e133f206d47", "ja": "最上さん、合格だ。これから俺と一緒に、\nトップアイドルを目指して頑張ろう！", "zh": "最上小姐，你被录取了。\n今后就跟我一起以顶尖偶像为目标，好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_2001_015siz", "source_sha256": "668e9622c2c960b47d2351d247e4cff420f57eef297108dff51c6a95941ec116", "ja": "本当ですか……！？\nあ、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "真的吗……！？\n谢、谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_001_2002_015siz", "source_sha256": "9cc84e9262752a31439f5526f83b96ac005b97ee18c3221317f75a7dc2a0008a", "ja": "私、本気でトップアイドルを目指します！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我会认真以顶尖偶像为目标努力！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
